# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "T/F One can simultaneously measure $X$ and $Z$, but not $Y$.\n"
msgstr "T/F $X$와 $Z$는 동시에 측정할 수 있지만 $Y$는 불가능하다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "T/F Linear position and linear momentum operators do not commute.\n"
msgstr "T/F 선형 위치 연산자와 선형 운동량 연산자는 교환되지 않는다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"T/F IBM quantum computers measure along $Z$ by default, so a rotation must "
"be performed to measure along any other direction.\n"
msgstr "T/F IBM 양자 컴퓨터는 기본적으로 $Z$ 방향으로 측정하므로, 다른 방향으로 측정하려면 회전이 필요하다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "T/F The circuit below effectively measures $Z$ and then $X$.\n"
msgstr "T/F 아래 Circuit은 $Z$를 먼저 측정한 후 $X$를 측정하는 것과 동일한 효과를 낸다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![A circuit diagram showing a measurement, a Hadamard gate, and then another"
" measurement.](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/exploring-"
"uncertainty-with-qiskit/tf-q5.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![측정, Hadamard Gate, 그리고 또 다른 측정을 보여주는 Circuit "
"다이어그램.](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/exploring-uncertainty-"
"with-qiskit/tf-q5.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "MC Questions: {#mc-questions}"
msgstr "객관식(MC) 문제: {#mc-questions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The diagram below demonstrates which of the following uncertainty "
"relations?\n"
msgstr "아래 다이어그램은 다음 중 어떤 불확정성 관계를 나타내나요?\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "a. $\\Delta X \\Delta Y \\geq |\\langle Z \\rangle|$\n"
msgstr "a. $\\Delta X \\Delta Y \\geq |\\langle Z \\rangle|$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "b. $\\Delta Y \\Delta Z \\geq |\\langle X \\rangle|$\n"
msgstr "b. $\\Delta Y \\Delta Z \\geq |\\langle X \\rangle|$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "c. $\\Delta Z \\Delta X \\geq |\\langle Y \\rangle|$\n"
msgstr "c. $\\Delta Z \\Delta X \\geq |\\langle Y \\rangle|$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "d. None of the above\n"
msgstr "d. 위 항목 모두 해당 없음\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![A plot comparing uncertainty to the maximum expectation value of the Y "
"operator.](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/exploring-uncertainty-"
"with-qiskit/checkin.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Y 연산자의 최대 기댓값과 불확정도를 비교하는 그래프.](/learning/images/modules/quantum-"
"mechanics/exploring-uncertainty-with-qiskit/checkin.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Which of the following is the standard sequence to perform a measurement "
"along $x$?\n"
msgstr "$x$ 방향으로 측정을 수행하기 위한 표준 순서는 무엇인가요?\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "a. Only ```qc.measure()```\n"
msgstr "a. ```qc.measure()```만 사용\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "b. ```qc.h()``` then ```qc.measure()```\n"
msgstr "b. ```qc.h()``` 후 ```qc.measure()```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "c. ```qc.h()```, ```qc.h()``` then ```qc.measure()```\n"
msgstr "c. ```qc.h()```, ```qc.h()``` 후 ```qc.measure()```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "d. ```qc.h()```, ```qc.s```, ```qc.h()```then ```qc.measure()```\n"
msgstr "d. ```qc.h()```, ```qc.s```, ```qc.h()``` 후 ```qc.measure()```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "e. ```qc.sdg()```, ```qc.h()```, ```qc.s``` then ```qc.measure()```\n"
msgstr "e. ```qc.sdg()```, ```qc.h()```, ```qc.s``` 후 ```qc.measure()```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"f. ```qc.sdg()```, ```qc.h()```, ```qc.s```, ```qc.h()``` then "
"```qc.measure()```\n"
msgstr ""
"f. ```qc.sdg()```, ```qc.h()```, ```qc.s```, ```qc.h()``` 후 "
"```qc.measure()```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Which of the following states yields the largest expectation value $\\langle"
" X \\rangle$?\n"
msgstr "다음 중 가장 큰 기댓값 $\\langle X \\rangle$를 나타내는 상태는 무엇인가요?\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "a. $|+\\rangle_x$\n"
msgstr "a. $|+\\rangle_x$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "b. $|-\\rangle_x$\n"
msgstr "b. $|-\\rangle_x$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "c. $|+\\rangle_y$ also called $|+i\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "c. $|+\\rangle_y$ ($|+i\\rangle$라고도 함)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "d. $|-\\rangle_y$ also called $|-i\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "d. $|-\\rangle_y$ ($|-i\\rangle$라고도 함)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "e. $|0\\rangle$ also called $|\\uparrow\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "e. $|0\\rangle$ ($|\\uparrow\\rangle$라고도 함)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "f. $|1\\rangle$ also called $|\\downarrow\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "f. $|1\\rangle$ ($|\\downarrow\\rangle$라고도 함)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Which of the following states yields the largest uncertainty $\\Delta X$?\n"
msgstr "다음 중 가장 큰 불확정도 $\\Delta X$를 나타내는 상태는 무엇인가요?\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "b. $|+\\rangle_y$ also called $|+i\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "b. $|+\\rangle_y$ ($|+i\\rangle$라고도 함)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "c. $|0\\rangle$ also called $|\\uparrow\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "c. $|0\\rangle$ ($|\\uparrow\\rangle$라고도 함)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "d. a and b are tied\n"
msgstr "d. a와 b가 동률\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "e. b and c are tied\n"
msgstr "e. b와 c가 동률\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "f. a, b, and c are tied\n"
msgstr "f. a, b, c 모두 동률\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Discussion Questions: {#discussion-questions}"
msgstr "토론 문제: {#discussion-questions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Does this concept of uncertainty conflict in any way with the notion of spin"
" as a vector arrow in Cartesian space? How about on the Bloch sphere?\n"
msgstr ""
"이 불확정성의 개념은 카르테시안 공간에서 스핀을 벡터 화살표로 나타내는 개념과 어떤 방식으로든 충돌하나요? 블로흐 구(Bloch "
"sphere)에서는 어떤가요?\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Suppose you orient a measurement device along a direction half-way between "
"the $x$ and $y$ axes. What happens? Can you make a measurement along this "
"direction? How does this relate to uncertainty in $X$ and $Y$?\n"
msgstr ""
"$x$ 축과 $y$ 축의 중간 방향으로 측정 장치를 배치한다고 가정해 보세요. 어떤 일이 일어날까요? 이 방향으로 측정이 가능한가요? "
"이것이 $X$와 $Y$의 불확정성과 어떤 관련이 있나요?\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What additional experiments would you like to do to convince yourself of the"
" results obtained here?\n"
msgstr "여기서 얻은 결과를 더 확신하기 위해 어떤 추가 실험을 해보고 싶으신가요?\n"
